// CELL
// The lithium pouch. Sized for the cell cavity to hold it without compression,
// because a pouch cell under sustained pressure is a hazard.

// Cell cavity length. [PROVISIONAL]
//   TODO(verify): the bill of materials does not name a specific cell yet, and
//   cannot until the current draw of each tier has been measured. These
//   dimensions are for a common 1S pouch in the 150 to 250 mAh range and will be
